  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-d977f7b20691a7a30c99740a",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "图 6.50 给出了闭环带宽随相角裕度（PM）变化的关系。较小的 PM 值会导致频率响应中出现更高的峰值。带宽由幅值下降至 0.7（-3 dB）处确定。随着 PM 减小，带宽增加并超过 ω_c，可达到 2ω_c 等数值。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Figure 6.50 shows closed-loop bandwidth with respect to PM. Lower PM values lead to higher peaking in the frequency response. Bandwidth is indicated where magnitude drops to 0.7 (-3 dB). As PM decreases, bandwidth increases beyond ω_c, reaching values such as 2ω_c.",
